{"seq":10,"slug":"lint-format-as-agent-guardrails","title":"Lint 与格式化作为 Agent 护栏","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails","rating":{"composite":4.07,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"lint-与格式化作为-agent-护栏-简介\">Lint 与格式化作为 Agent 护栏 简介</h1><p>当 agent 大量产出代码，人来逐条检查风格、抓低级问题、统一格式既跟不上也没必要。lint 和格式化（formatter）正是把这些机械、可自动化的检查交给机器：lint 自动抓住一类真问题和违反约定的写法、formatter 自动统一所有代码的风格——它们是 agent 写代码时一道不知疲倦、确定、即时的护栏。本 hub 讲如何用 lint 和格式化作为 agent 的自动护栏：让机器挡住机械的问题、把人和 agent 的注意力解放到真正需要判断的地方、让产出一致、让评审聚焦。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么、不讲什么</h2><p>本 hub 只聚焦 lint 和 formatter 这两类<strong>机械的、确定的、可自动化</strong>的护栏：它们抓什么、怎么配得准、怎么强制、怎么维护。它<strong>不</strong>展开类型、测试、评审、CI 这些相邻的护栏——那些各有专门的 hub。把本 hub 放进「AI 原生工程」这一层级的护栏体系里看，边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>去这个 hub</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>格式 / lint（机械、确定）</td>\n<td>本 hub</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型作为契约护栏</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-friendly-typescript-project/\">AI 友好的 TypeScript 项目</a></td>\n<td>与 lint 互补：类型管形状契约，lint 管运行时隐患与约定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试作为行为护栏</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-friendly-testing/\">AI 友好的测试</a></td>\n<td>同为 agent 的即时反馈护栏，但验证的是行为而非风格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评审（判断性、不可自动化）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-assisted-code-review-quality/\">AI 辅助的代码评审与质量</a></td>\n<td>护栏挡机械的、评审管判断的，两者分工互补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把多道检查串成门禁 / CI</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/\">AI 友好的构建与工具链</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 的检查最终落在那里的 CI 流水线里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把约定写给 agent 看</td>\n<td><a href=\"../project-context-files/\">项目上下文文件</a></td>\n<td>能编码的进 lint，编不了的进 AGENTS.md，二者互补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交 / PR / 钩子</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-native-git-workflow/\">AI 原生的 Git 工作流</a></td>\n<td>提交时自动格式化、PR 干净 diff 靠那里的自动化落地</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话边界：<strong>凡是「有确定规则、机器能判过/不过」的代码检查归本 hub；需要人判断的归评审；验证行为的归测试；管契约形状的归类型。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>想先建立心智模型（所有人）</strong>：按章读完即可。第一章先想清「为什么 agent 时代这道护栏价值被放大」，再看后三章的怎么做。</li>\n<li><strong>要立刻给项目配 lint/formatter 的工程师</strong>：先读 <a href=\"linting-as-a-guardrail/rules-that-catch-real-problems\">抓真问题的规则</a> → <a href=\"linting-as-a-guardrail/signal-over-noise\">信噪比与别淹没 Agent</a> → <a href=\"enforcing-and-evolving/lint-and-format-as-gates\">Lint 与格式化作为门禁</a>，这条线直接对应「配什么规则、别配什么、怎么强制」。</li>\n<li><strong>负责团队约定与规范的 Tech Lead</strong>：重点读 <a href=\"linting-as-a-guardrail/encoding-conventions-as-rules\">把约定编码成规则</a> 和 <a href=\"enforcing-and-evolving/maintaining-the-ruleset\">维护规则集</a>，再延伸到 <a href=\"../project-context-files/\">项目上下文文件</a> 把编不了的约定写给 agent。</li>\n<li><strong>关注 agent 体验与回路速度的人</strong>：读 <a href=\"lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age/deterministic-style-frees-attention\">确定的风格解放注意力</a> 与 <a href=\"enforcing-and-evolving/fast-feedback-in-the-loop\">回路里的快速反馈</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>知道 lint 和 formatter 大致是干什么的（用过 ESLint/Prettier 之类即可，无需精通）。</li>\n<li>理解「门禁 / CI」的基本概念——本 hub 的强制部分假设你知道提交钩子和 CI 检查的存在。</li>\n<li>熟悉「agent 大量产出代码」这一前提；若对 AI 时代护栏的整体格局还没概念，可先浏览同级的 <a href=\"../ai-assisted-code-review-quality/\">AI 辅助的代码评审与质量</a> 与 <a href=\"../ai-friendly-testing/\">AI 友好的测试</a> 建立全景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"全篇结构\">全篇结构</h2><p>第一章讲 AI 时代的 lint 与格式化——自动护栏胜过人工机械检查、lint 与格式化为 agent 做了什么、确定的风格如何解放注意力；第二章讲 lint 作为护栏——抓真问题的规则、把约定编码成规则、信噪比（别用海量低价值规则淹没 agent）；第三章讲格式化作为基线——保存与提交时自动格式化、格式化消除风格争论、一致的 diff 利于评审；第四章讲强制与演进——lint 与格式化作为门禁、回路里的快速反馈、维护规则集。贯穿全篇的主线是：lint 和格式化把「一致性和低级正确性」从靠人自觉、靠评审逐条抓，变成机器自动、即时、确定地强制——它们是 agent 时代成本最低、回报最高的一类护栏，但要配得准（抓真问题、不淹没）、强制得住（进门禁）、维护得好（随项目演进）。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age","title":"Lint And Format In The Ai Age","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"automated-guardrails-vs-manual-review","title":"自动护栏胜过人工机械检查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age/automated-guardrails-vs-manual-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-lint-and-format-do-for-agents","title":"Lint 与格式化为 Agent 做了什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age/what-lint-and-format-do-for-agents"},{"seq":3,"slug":"deterministic-style-frees-attention","title":"确定的风格解放注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age/deterministic-style-frees-attention"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"linting-as-a-guardrail","title":"Linting As A Guardrail","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/linting-as-a-guardrail","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rules-that-catch-real-problems","title":"抓真问题的规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/linting-as-a-guardrail/rules-that-catch-real-problems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"encoding-conventions-as-rules","title":"把约定编码成规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/linting-as-a-guardrail/encoding-conventions-as-rules"},{"seq":3,"slug":"signal-over-noise","title":"信噪比与别淹没 Agent","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/linting-as-a-guardrail/signal-over-noise"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"formatting-as-a-baseline","title":"Formatting As A Baseline","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/formatting-as-a-baseline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"auto-format-on-save-and-commit","title":"保存与提交时自动格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/formatting-as-a-baseline/auto-format-on-save-and-commit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"format-removes-style-debates","title":"格式化消除风格争论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/formatting-as-a-baseline/format-removes-style-debates"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistent-diffs-for-review","title":"一致的 diff 利于评审","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/formatting-as-a-baseline/consistent-diffs-for-review"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"enforcing-and-evolving","title":"Enforcing And Evolving","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/enforcing-and-evolving","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lint-and-format-as-gates","title":"Lint 与格式化作为门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/enforcing-and-evolving/lint-and-format-as-gates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fast-feedback-in-the-loop","title":"回路里的快速反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/enforcing-and-evolving/fast-feedback-in-the-loop"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maintaining-the-ruleset","title":"维护规则集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/enforcing-and-evolving/maintaining-the-ruleset"}]}]}